	<tr align=left>
			<td class="MainB"><b>PVP Server Announcement Delay</b><!--strTitle-->
			- 2002-04-05 11:21:47</td> <!--'strDate-->
	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			We really, really thought we'd be ready to post the final details of our upcoming "hardcore" server earlier this week. (Side note - thank you very much for the hundreds of thoughtful posts and emails. I have read them all and put them together into a feedback report for the dev team.) However, there are still a few points we need to hammer out. There is a chance that if we put up the working document today, we'd have to reverse ourselves on a few major systems. This would be A Bad Thing (TM). Our final internal discussion will be held early next week, and the results posted immediately thereafter.

<p>I know that many of you are eagerly looking forward to hearing about the new server, and we want to make sure that what you read is what you're going to get.<!--strDesc-->
			<p></td>
	</tr>
	
