	<tr align=left>
			<td class="MainB"><b>Pendragon Patch Notes 1.49</b><!--strTitle-->
			- 2002-04-02 16:47:09</td> <!--'strDate-->
	</tr>
	<tr>	
			<td class="MainB">		
			These are real patch notes, as opposed to the plethora of "patch notes" floating around yesterday =) Just in case anyone is still confused, no, there is no pending merger between us and any other game. It was an April Fool's gag from those wild and crazy guys at the Catacombs. 

<p>(Edit 4/3/02 - nothing's changed, other than some small grammar and spelling errors. Thanks, all you eagle eyed people! Also, credit where credit is due, let me note that the Other Game/DAOC merger rumor was started by the asylum inmates at <a href="http://camelot.allakhazam.com">Allakhazam's</a>. The loons at <a href="http://daoc.catacombs.com">Catacombs</a> came up with the "Mythic hires people from Other Game to make DAOC more like the Other Game" rumor. They are both freaks, both funny, and both THE PERPETRATORS OF APRIL FOOLS JOKES. I love you all more than cheese dip. Please stop emailing me about the two rumors ;).<!--strDesc-->
			<p></td>
	</tr>
	
